  "setup": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "the merchants",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "starting_florins"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "ship_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "ship_value",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "ship_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "ship_favoured",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "grain_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "cloth_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "spice_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "dye_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "favour_pool",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[g for i in [1, 2] for g in ['Grain', 'Cloth', 'Spice', 'Dye'] if i <= (favour_pool_copies_5_to_6_players if len(players) >= 5 else favour_pool_copies_3_to_4_players)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "label": "deal the favoured goods",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "favour_pool[min(int(uniform(0, len(favour_pool))), len(favour_pool) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 1"
            },
            "key": "favoured_good",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "favour_pool",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "favour_pool[min(int(uniform(0, len(favour_pool))), len(favour_pool) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 2"
            },
            "key": "favoured_good",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "favour_pool",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "favour_pool[min(int(uniform(0, len(favour_pool))), len(favour_pool) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 3"
            },
            "key": "favoured_good",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "favour_pool",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "favour_pool[min(int(uniform(0, len(favour_pool))), len(favour_pool) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 4"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 4"
            },
            "key": "favoured_good",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 4"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "favour_pool",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 4"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "favour_pool[min(int(uniform(0, len(favour_pool))), len(favour_pool) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 5"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 5"
            },
            "key": "favoured_good",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 5"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "favour_pool",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 5"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "favour_pool[min(int(uniform(0, len(favour_pool))), len(favour_pool) - 1)]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 6"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == 6"
            },
            "key": "favoured_good",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 6"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "favour_pool",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "len(players) >= 6"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "label": "the ledgers open",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "You start with:"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "a new round",
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "active_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "((round - 1) % len(players)) + 1"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "lot",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round} begins. Seat {active_seat} is the active seat."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "day start: the deck",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round % (rounds_per_day_per_player * len(players)) == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[g + '-' + '012345'[i] for g in ['Grain', 'Cloth', 'Spice', 'Dye'] for i in [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5] for k in [1, 2, 3] if k <= [value_0_cards_per_good, value_1_cards_per_good, value_2_cards_per_good, value_3_cards_per_good, value_4_cards_per_good, value_5_cards_per_good][i]]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "A new day begins: the deck is rebuilt as all {deck_size} cards and shuffled."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "start",
      "label": "day start: the ships",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round % (rounds_per_day_per_player * len(players)) == 1"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "ship_cards",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "ship_value",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "ship_count",
            "value": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "ship_favoured",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Every ship is emptied for the new day. Florins and cumulative good counts are kept."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "the reveal",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "revealed",
            "value": []
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "revealed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "revealed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[min(int(uniform(0, len(deck))), len(deck) - 1)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "revealed",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Round {round}: revealed cards 1, 2 and 3, in order: {revealed}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "lot",
      "label": "lot size",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == active_seat"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "lot_size_min"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "lot_size_max"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "chosen_size"
      },
      "text": "You are the active seat. The revealed cards, in order, are {revealed}. Choose the lot size: 1, 2 or 3. The lot is the first that many revealed cards; the rest are discarded for the day."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "lot",
      "label": "the lot",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "lot_size",
            "value": "$chosen_size"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "lot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[revealed[i] for i in [0, 1, 2] if i < lot_size and i < len(revealed)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard + [revealed[i] for i in [0, 1, 2] if i >= lot_size and i < len(revealed)]"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "revealed",
            "value": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {active_seat} sets a lot of {lot_size}: {lot}. The other revealed cards are discarded for the day."
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "your ledger",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Before you bid, your ledger:"
    },
    {
      "use": "poll",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "sealed bids",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.florins > 0"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "number",
        "min": {
          "calc": "bid_min"
        },
        "max": {
          "calc": "you.florins"
        }
      },
      "store": "bid",
      "text": "The lot is {lot} ({lot_size} cards). Write a sealed bid: a whole number from 0 to your current florins; 0 is a pass. If your ship count plus the lot size would exceed {ship_capacity}, your bid is voided to 0. If the highest bid is above 0 and exactly one player made it, that player pays it to the bank and takes the lot; if all bids are 0 or two or more tie for highest, the lot is discarded and nobody pays."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "void bids that do not fit",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.ship_count + lot_size > ship_capacity"
            },
            "key": "bid",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "the high bid",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_bid",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.bid for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "high_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(p.bid == high_bid for p in players)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "bid",
      "label": "pay",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "winner_seat",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min([p.seat for p in players if p.bid == high_bid]) if high_bid > 0 and high_count == 1 else 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "winner_seat > 0 and you.seat == winner_seat and you.florins >= you.bid"
            },
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-you.bid"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} wins the lot for {high_bid}, paid to the bank."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "discard + lot"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "winner_seat == 0"
            },
            "text": "No sale: the lot is discarded and nobody pays."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "load",
      "label": "load the ship",
      "when": {
        "calc": "winner_seat > 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "ship_cards",
            "value": {
              "calc": "you.ship_cards + lot"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "ship_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sum([v for c in lot for v in [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5] if c[len(c) - 1] == '012345'[v]])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "ship_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "lot_size"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "ship_favoured",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(c[0] == you.favoured_good[0] for c in lot)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "grain_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(c[0] == 'G' for c in lot)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "cloth_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(c[0] == 'C' for c in lot)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "spice_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(c[0] == 'S' for c in lot)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == winner_seat"
            },
            "key": "dye_count",
            "value": {
              "calc": "count(c[0] == 'D' for c in lot)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "load",
      "label": "the auction result",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Auction result for round {round}: lot {lot}. Bids after voiding [seat, bid]: {[[p.seat, p.bid] for p in players]}. Winner: seat {winner_seat} at price {high_bid} (winner 0 means no sale)."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "day end",
      "label": "day end: top ships",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round % (rounds_per_day_per_player * len(players)) == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "top_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.ship_value for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "second_value",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.ship_value for p in players if p.ship_value < top_value] + [0])"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "day end",
      "label": "day end: ship bonuses",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round % (rounds_per_day_per_player * len(players)) == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "top_value > 0 and you.ship_value == top_value"
            },
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "top_ship_bonus"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has the most valuable ship and gains {top_ship_bonus} florins."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "second_value > 0 and you.ship_value == second_value"
            },
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "second_ship_bonus"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} has the second most valuable ship and gains {second_ship_bonus} florins."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "day end",
      "label": "day end: majorities",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round % (rounds_per_day_per_player * len(players)) == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "grain_max",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.grain_count for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "cloth_max",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.cloth_count for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "spice_max",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.spice_count for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "dye_max",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([p.dye_count for p in players])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "grain_max >= majority_min_count and you.grain_count == grain_max"
            },
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "majority_bonus"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} holds the Grain majority and gains {majority_bonus} florins."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "cloth_max >= majority_min_count and you.cloth_count == cloth_max"
            },
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "majority_bonus"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} holds the Cloth majority and gains {majority_bonus} florins."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "spice_max >= majority_min_count and you.spice_count == spice_max"
            },
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "majority_bonus"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} holds the Spice majority and gains {majority_bonus} florins."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": {
              "where": "dye_max >= majority_min_count and you.dye_count == dye_max"
            },
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "majority_bonus"
            },
            "text": "Seat {player} holds the Dye majority and gains {majority_bonus} florins."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "day end",
      "label": "day end: favoured goods",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round % (rounds_per_day_per_player * len(players)) == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "adjust": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "florins",
            "value": {
              "calc": "favoured_card_bonus * you.ship_favoured"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "day end",
      "label": "day end report",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round % (rounds_per_day_per_player * len(players)) == 0"
      },
      "to": "all",
      "text": "The day ends. Top ship value {top_value}, second {second_value}. Ship values [seat, value]: {[[p.seat, p.ship_value] for p in players]}. Cumulative counts [seat, grain, cloth, spice, dye]: {[[p.seat, p.grain_count, p.cloth_count, p.spice_count, p.dye_count] for p in players]}. Highest counts: Grain {grain_max}, Cloth {cloth_max}, Spice {spice_max}, Dye {dye_max}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "day end",
      "label": "after the last round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds_per_game_per_player * len(players)"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "round >= rounds_per_game_per_player * len(players)"
      },
      "rank_by": "you.florins",
      "reveal": [
        "florins",
        "favoured_good"
      ],
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Final florins [seat, florins]: {[[p.seat, p.florins] for p in players]}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 36,
    "rounds_max": 36,
    "actions_max": 3000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "SETUP. Each player starts with {starting_florins} florins, known only to that player, and an empty ship that holds at most {ship_capacity} cards. Each player has cumulative counts of 0 for each of the four goods: Grain, Cloth, Spice and Dye. Before round 1, each player is dealt a secret FAVOURED GOOD from a favour pool. With 3 or 4 players the pool is the 4 goods once each ({favour_pool_copies_3_to_4_players} copy). With 5 or 6 players the pool is the 4 goods twice each ({favour_pool_copies_5_to_6_players} copies, 8 tiles). The pool is shuffled once and one tile is dealt to each player. Favoured goods stay secret until the end.\n\nDECK. The deck has {deck_size} cards: {cards_per_good} per good. Each good has the values 0,1,1,2,2,3,3,3,4,4,5,5, which sum to {value_sum_per_good}. All four goods are identical in value. Cards are written Good-Value, for example Spice-3.\n\nLENGTH. A day lasts {rounds_per_day_per_player}N rounds (N = number of players). The game lasts {rounds_per_game_per_player}N rounds ({days} days): 18 with 3 players, 24 with 4, 30 with 5 and 36 with 6. The active seat in a round is ((round-1) mod N)+1, so each seat is active exactly twice per day.\n\nEACH ROUND, in this order:\n1. DAY START (only when round mod 2N = 1): the deck is rebuilt as all {deck_size} cards and shuffled once, and every player's ship value, ship count and ship favoured count become 0. Cumulative good counts and florins are kept.\n2. REVEAL: the top {revealed_cards_per_round} cards of the deck are shown to everyone, in order, as revealed cards 1, 2 and 3.\n3. LOT SIZE: the active seat alone chooses {lot_size_min}, 2 or {lot_size_max} (always allowed, even if their own ship could not hold the lot).\n4. LOT: the lot is the first that many revealed cards. Any other revealed cards are discarded for the rest of the day.\n5. BIDS: every player, the active seat included, secretly writes a whole-number bid from {bid_min} to their current florins, all at the same moment. A bid of 0 is a pass. A player with 0 florins bids 0.\n6. VOID: a player's bid becomes 0 if their ship count plus the lot size would exceed {ship_capacity}. They may still bid, but the bid counts as 0.\n7. PAY: if the highest bid is above 0 and exactly one player made it, that player pays their bid to the bank (those florins leave the game) and wins the lot. Otherwise, meaning all bids are 0 or two or more players tie for the highest, the lot is discarded, nobody pays and there is no sale.\n8. LOAD: on a sale, the winner adds the lot's card values to their ship value and the lot size to their ship count, adds 1 to their ship favoured count for each lot card of their favoured good, and 1 to their cumulative count of each good for each lot card of that good.\n9. ANNOUNCE: the lot, every bid, and the winner and price, or 'no sale', are shown to everyone.\n10. DAY END (only when round mod 2N = 0): every player whose ship value equals the highest ship value, if it is above 0, gains {top_ship_bonus} florins. Every player whose ship value equals the highest ship value strictly below that top value, if it is above 0, gains {second_ship_bonus} florins. For each of the four goods, every player whose cumulative count equals the highest count of that good, if it is at least {majority_min_count}, gains {majority_bonus} florins. Each player gains {favoured_card_bonus} florins per card of their favoured good on their ship.\n11. GAME END: if round = {rounds_per_game_per_player}N, the game ends after that day's payouts. Otherwise the next round begins.\n\nThere is no talk. Each player sees only their own florins and favoured good. Lots, all bids, prices, ships and cumulative counts are public.\n\nWINNING. After the last round, the player with the most florins wins. If two or more players tie for the most florins, they share the win."
}
